{
  "meta": {
    "name": "diet_reference",
    "version": "1.0",
    "note": "Same shape as allergens/allergen_reference.json and read by the same matcher. Covers what diets avoid that isn't an allergen. Written for this app from the ingredient names in the recipe data, not from an outside source. Phrases are normalized when loaded."
